<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>SubFuse 1.0.1</title></head><body>
<h2>Automatic refresh fix</h2>
<p>SubFuse now keeps your selected automatic refresh frequency when one subscription cannot update. Other accounts continue refreshing on schedule instead of slowing down together.</p>
<ul>
<li>Recover automatically from the longer delay saved by SubFuse 1.0, without resetting your settings.</li>
<li>Continue showing accounts that need attention, while preserving their previous readings.</li>
<li>Retry less often when no subscriptions can refresh.</li>
</ul>
<p>Requires Apple Silicon and macOS 14 or later. Profiles, remembered sign-ins, widgets and update compatibility are preserved.</p>
</body></html>
